        "vehicle_name": "The Professional Services Schedule (PSS) (00CORP)",
        "vehicle_description": "Enables Federal agencies to procure total professional service solutions using a single Multiple Award Schedule. PSS contractors possess expertise related to an array of professional services including business consulting and program support services, financial consulting solutions, environmental services, engineering services, advertising and integrated marketing services, logistics support and language services. PSS consolidated the following previously separate schedules: Financial and Business Solutions (FABS - Schedule 520), Advertising & Integrated Marketing Solutions (AIMS - Schedule 541), Language Services (Schedule 738 II), Professional Engineering Services (PES - Schedule 871), Mission Oriented Business Integrated Services (MOBIS - Schedule 874), Logistics Worldwide (LOGWORLD - Schedule 874 V), Environmental Services (Schedule 899). This schedule was consolidated into the Multiple Award Schedule (MAS) in 2020.",
